# The Prisoner's Dilemma, as Rick Uller (Levellass and the community, 2021, v1.0) as a Keen Worlds world.
# Written by kwtools/kw_prisoner.py from the mod's CKPatch file; the data
# files beside it are the player's copy of the mod. It runs on Keen 6.

%string ca_tileInfo "TILEINFO.CK6"

%stringarray ck_str_levelNames
	"A-Danac 2 & 3  ",
